IONS OF ABOUT $1.70 TO $1.90.PENTAIR PLC - CONFIRMED FY ESTIMATED 2020 GAAP EPS SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS OF ABOUT $2.00 TO $2.20.PENTAIR PLC - CONTINUES TO EXPECT 2020 SALES OF ABOUT $2.8 BILLION AND TO TARGET FREE CASH FLOW OF GREATER THAN 100 PERCENT OF NET INCOME.'}{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2020-09-11 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Quest Diagnostics Updates Outlook For Full Year 2020', 'text': "QUEST DIAGNOSTICS UPDATES OUTLOOK FOR FULL YEAR 2020.REVENUES FOR FULL YEAR 2020 NOW EXPECTED TO BE $8.4-8.8 BILLION COMPARED TO PREVIOUS OUTLOOK OF $8.0-8.6 BILLION.REPORTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE (EPS) FOR FULL YEAR 2020 NOW EXPECTED TO BE $7.42-$8.92.ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS FOR FULL YEAR 2020 NOW EXPECTED TO BE $7.50-$9.00 COMPARED TO PREVIOUS OUTLOOK OF $6.60-$8.60.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $8.51, REVENUE VIEW $8.72 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QUEST DIAGNOSTICS - CASH PROVIDED BY OPERATIONS FOR FY 2020 NOW EXPECTED TO BE AT LEAST $1.45 BILLION COMPARED TO PREVIOUS OUTLOOK OF AT LEAST $1.25 BILLION.QUEST DIAGNOSTICS - SINCE JULY 23, ORGANIC TESTING VOLUMES IN BASE BUSINESS CONTINUED TO RECOVER FASTER THAN ANTICIPATED THROUGH END OF AUGUST.COVID-19 MOLECULAR AND ANTIBODY TESTING VOLUMES REMAIN CONSISTENT WITH COMPANY'S PREVIOUS OUTLOOK.QUEST DIAGNOSTICS - ORGANIC BASE TESTING VOLUMES DECLINED HIGH SINGLE DIGITS IN JULY,MID-TO-HIGH SINGLE DIGITS IN AUG PERCENTAGE BASIS VERSUS PRIOR YEAR."}{'symbol': 'UHS', 'date': '2020-09-11 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Universal Health Services Announces Pricing Of Senior Secured Notes Offering', 'text': 'UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES OFFERING.UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES INC -  PRICED OFFERING OF $800 MILLION OF ITS 2.650% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2030.'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2020-09-11 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Walmart To Pay $20 Mln To Settle EEOC Nationwide Hiring Discrimination Case', 'text': 'WALMART, INC. TO PAY $20 MILLION TO SETTLE EEOC NATIONWIDE H